Today section 6 is the closed stale-word log, not a residual
track list. Residual stay-facts live in `### 5.1`.
START still says "Section 6 residual tracks."
A rewrite that renames or drops §5 / §6 makes START false.
A rewrite that keeps §6 as the closed log leaves START's
"residual tracks" words already false.

RULES.oot 1.15 uses the same "later residual tracks" phrase.
It does not name section numbers.

